an begin="33.248" end="33.556">I</span> <span begin="33.556" end="33.820">can</span> <span begin="33.820" end="34.112">do</span> <span begin="34.112" end="34.452">with</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他说有大把姑娘我可以交往</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="34.684" end="34.803"><span begin="34.684" end="34.803">(Uh)</span></span></p><p begin="35.238" end="37.030" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="35.238" end="35.515">But</span> <span begin="35.515" end="35.759">I</span> <span begin="35.759" end="36.106">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="36.106" end="36.650">without</span> <span begin="36.650" end="37.030">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我不能没有你</span></p><p begin="36.394" end="39.036" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.394" end="36.660">I</span> <span begin="36.660" end="36.901">knew</span> <span begin="36.901" end="37.037">him</span> <span begin="37.037" end="37.830">forever</span> <span begin="37.830" end="38.151">in</span> <span begin="38.151" end="38.381">a</span> <span begin="38.381" end="39.036">minute</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">短短一分钟却像认识了他一生</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="39.220" end="39.338"><span begin="39.220" end="39.338">(Hey)</span></span></p><p begin="39.825" end="41.562" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="39.825" end="40.007">That</span> <span begin="40.007" end="40.674">summer</span> <span begin="40.674" end="40.975">night</span> <span begin="40.975" end="41.213">in</span> <span begin="41.213" end="41.562">June</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个六月的夏夜</span></p><p begin="40.972" end="43.706" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.972" end="41.215">And</span> <span begin="41.215" end="41.579">papa</span> <span begin="41.579" end="41.900">says</span> <span begin="41.900" end="42.115">he</span> <span begin="42.115" end="42.413">got</span> <span begin="42.413" end="42.972">malo</span> <span begin="42.972" end="43.246">in</span> <span begin="43.246" end="43.706">him</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爸爸说他身上有股邪气</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="43.803" end="44.008"><span begin="43.803" end="44.008">(Uh)</span></span></p><p begin="44.387" end="45.813" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.387" end="44.649">He</span> <span begin="44.649" end="44.985">got</span> <span begin="44.985" end="45.236">me</span> <span begin="45.236" end="45.539">feelin&apos;</span> <span begin="45.539" end="45.813">like...</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可他让我感觉……</span></p><p begin="45.813" end="48.702" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.813" end="46.711">Ooh,</span> <span begin="46.711" end="47.008">ooh-</span><span begin="47.008" end="47.285">ooh-</span><span begin="47.285" end="47.542">ooh-</span><span begin="47.542" end="47.861">ooh-</span><span begin="47.861" end="48.166">ooh-</span><span begin="48.166" end="48.421">ooh-</span><span begin="48.421" end="48.702">ooh</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="48.789" end="48.965"><span begin="48.789" end="48.965">(Ayy)</span></span></p><p begin="48.965" end="53.262" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.965" end="49.284">I</span> <span begin="49.284" end="49.563">knew</span> <span begin="49.563" end="49.822">it</span> <span begin="49.822" end="50.129">when</span> <span begin="50.129" end="50.222">I</span> <span begin="50.426" end="50.717">met</span> <span begin="50.717" end="50.959">him,</span> <span begin="51.238" end="51.502">I</span> <span begin="51.502" end="51.815">loved</span> <span begin="51.815" end="52.111">him</span> <span begin="52.111" end="52.412">when</span> <span begin="52.412" end="52.644">I</span> <span begin="52.644" end="52.940">left</span> <span begin="52.940" end="53.262">him</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遇见他时我就知道 离开他时我已爱上</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="53.409" end="53.592"><span begin="53.409" end="53.592">(Ayy)</span></span></p><p be